/P 82 0 R
/E (At the end of the event, the dialogue reinforced a powerful message: Africa's future will be shaped not only by the capital it mobilises, but also by the quality, integrity, and accessibility of the information that guides how that capital is invested. Through its leadership at ASIS 2026, IMILI reaffirmed its commitment to advancing Media and Information Literacy as a catalyst for innovation, inclusive growth, democratic resilience, and sustainable development across Africa.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
